"fermions/transpiler-"
"passes-f-2-f-synthesis#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis "
"\"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.F2FSynthesis\") (see [Synthesize an "
"Evolution gate in fermionic space](fermionic-synthesis#fermionic-synthesis-"
